	(descr "Hirose DF40TC-30DP-0.4V(51), HRS CL0684-4263-0-51. 30-pos 0.4mm pitch double-row PLUG, no retention tab. One plug serves every DF40T stacking height 1.5-4.0mm; the height is set by the receptacle. Land pattern from DF40T/DF40GT catalog (Jan 2026) p.9: P=0.4, B=5.60, pad 0.23 wide, rows 3.37 outer / 2.05 inner -> 0.66 long at y=+-1.355. Body A=7.52, 2.97 wide, 1.14 above board. NO end pads: TC has no retention tabs (see docs/connector-pinout.md).")
